# Tech Stack

NestJS 11 REST API with TypeORM, PostgreSQL, JWT cookie auth, and MailerSend. See [project-structure.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/project-structure.mdc) for module layout.

## Runtime

| Component | Version | Notes |
|-----------|---------|-------|
| Node.js | **20** | `compose.yaml` uses `node:20`; `Dockerfile` uses `node:20-alpine` |
| PostgreSQL | **15** | `postgres:15-alpine` in Docker Compose |
| TypeScript | **5.9.3** | `module`/`moduleResolution`: `nodenext`; `target`: ES2023 |

